  "details": "It seems to be once you preload 1 world then preload other world, button changed to \"Preload World\" which is incorrect.\n\nAt least while within same session, status of preload kept as \"Clear Preload\" as button status.\n\n1. Preload 1st world\n\n2. Start preload 2nd world\n\n3. Back to 1st world page and now shown as \"Preload World\" instead shown as \"Clear Preload\"",
